msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/ai/configuration.rst:161
msgid "``ai.run_reaper_grace_seconds`` — how long past a task's own time limit the stuck-run reaper waits before it declares a run abandoned (default ``600``, i.e. 10 minutes). This is not a kill switch: to stop reaping altogether, deactivate the scheduled action instead."
