#: ../../content/applications/productivity/appointments.rst:123
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Restrictions` tab, :guilabel:`Allowed Domains` limits public booking to a comma-separated list of email domains."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/appointments.rst:125
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Generate share link` to obtain a :guilabel:`Share URL` that can be sent to customers. :guilabel:`Regenerate` invalidates the previous link."
