#: ../../content/applications/productivity/documents.rst:133
msgid "To run an operation, open a document and click :guilabel:`Operations` in the :guilabel:`Organize` section. Select the :guilabel:`Operation` and the target :guilabel:`Record`, then save: the document is attached to that record."
