#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:29
msgid ":guilabel:`Slug`: the technical identifier, generated from the name;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:30
msgid ":guilabel:`Description`: a short explanation of what belongs in the space;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Sequence`: the order of the spaces in the sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:33
msgid "Every page belongs to exactly one space, and a page can only be nested under a parent page of the same space."
