#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:37
msgid "Pages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:39
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Knowledge --> Content` to open the editor. The left sidebar shows the spaces and, inside each of them, the page tree; the selected page is displayed on the right."
