#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:43
msgid "Create and organize pages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:45
msgid "Click :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`New page` to add a page to a space, or :guilabel:`Add child page` on a page to nest a new page under it."
