#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:48
msgid "Give the page a :guilabel:`Title`, and click :guilabel:`Add icon` to pick an emoji shown next to the title in the tree. A **cover image** can be added at the top of the page and repositioned vertically."
