#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:51
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Wide layout` in the page settings to use the full width of the screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:61
msgid "Write content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:63
msgid "The editor toolbar offers the usual rich-text formatting:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:65
msgid "text styles: :guilabel:`Bold` (:command:`Ctrl` + :command:`B`), :guilabel:`Italic` (:command:`Ctrl` + :command:`I`), :guilabel:`Underline` (:command:`Ctrl` + :command:`U`), :guilabel:`Strikethrough`, and inline :guilabel:`Code`;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:68
msgid "structure: :guilabel:`Heading 1` to :guilabel:`Heading 3`, :guilabel:`Bullet List`, :guilabel:`Numbered List`, :guilabel:`Checklist`, :guilabel:`Blockquote`, :guilabel:`Callout`, :guilabel:`Code Block`, :guilabel:`Table`, :guilabel:`Horizontal Rule`, :guilabel:`Toggle / Expand` sections, and a :guilabel:`Table of Contents` generated from the headings;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:72
msgid "media and links: :guilabel:`Insert Link` (:command:`Ctrl` + :command:`K`), :guilabel:`Insert Image`, :guilabel:`Insert Video`, and :guilabel:`Insert File`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:75
msgid "Each time the body is saved, the page version is increased, and the page records who edited it and when. The top bar shows the current version and the last editor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:86
msgid "Favorites, locking, and trash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:88
msgid "Click the :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`(star)` icon to :guilabel:`Add to favorites`; favorite pages are listed at the top of the sidebar for quick access."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:90
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Lock page` to prevent the title and the body from being modified; :guilabel:`Unlock page` restores editing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:92
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send to trash` to remove a page from the tree without deleting it. Trashed pages keep a :guilabel:`Deletion Date` 30 days later, and can be restored until then."
