#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:96
msgid "Comments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:98
msgid "Select text in the body and click :guilabel:`Add Comment` to discuss a passage with colleagues. Each page also has a chatter, where followers are notified of the changes they are subscribed to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:102
msgid "Access rights of a page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:104
msgid "By default, a page is visible to all internal users. Open the :guilabel:`Page settings` and use the :guilabel:`Access Rights` section to change this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/knowledge.rst:107
msgid ":guilabel:`Base Access` sets the level applied to every internal user: :guilabel:`Full edit` (write), :guilabel:`Read only`, or :guilabel:`No access`."
