#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:856
msgid "Audit & verification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:858
msgid "eYssen Sign maintains an immutable, hash-chained audit trail for every signing request, providing strong evidence of document integrity and the signing process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:869
msgid "Hash-chained audit trail"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:871
msgid "Every action on a signing request creates an audit log entry. Each entry contains:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:873
msgid "**Action**: the type of event (e.g., ``created``, ``sent``, ``opened``, ``signer_completed``, ``signer_refused``, ``expired``, ``canceled``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:875
msgid "**Timestamp**: the server-side timestamp of the action (never client-supplied)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:876
msgid "**User / Partner**: the user or partner who performed the action."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:877
msgid "**IP address**: the IP address from which the action was performed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:878
msgid "**User agent**: the browser or client identification string."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:879
msgid "**Geolocation**: latitude and longitude (if captured during signing)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:880
msgid "**Previous hash**: the hash of the preceding log entry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:881
msgid "**Current hash**: the HMAC-SHA256 hash of this entry, computed using the previous hash and a server-side secret."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:884
msgid "The hash chain ensures that any tampering with or deletion of log entries is detectable. Each new entry cryptographically links to the previous one, forming an unbreakable chain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:888
msgid "Audit log entries are **immutable**. Any attempt to modify or delete a log entry raises an error. This guarantees the integrity of the audit trail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:892
msgid "Document verification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:894
msgid "eYssen Sign provides two levels of document verification:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:896
msgid "**Hash chain verification**: verifies that the entire audit log chain is intact by recomputing each entry's hash and comparing it to the stored value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:898
msgid "**PDF SHA-256 comparison**: computes the SHA-256 hash of the completed signed PDF and compares it to the hash recorded at the time of signing. Any modification to the PDF after signing is detected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:902
msgid "To verify a document, open the signing request and click :guilabel:`Verify Document`. The system reports whether the hash chain and document hash are valid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:906
msgid "Audit report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/sign.rst:908
msgid "An audit report can be generated for any completed signing request. The report includes the complete audit trail, signer information, timestamps, IP addresses, and the document hash. This report can be downloaded as a PDF and serves as supporting evidence of the signing process."
msgstr ""

